  "key_texts": [
    "Account and Data Deletion Request",
    "Last updated: 05/08/2026",
    "1. Right to request deletion",
    "2. How to make a request",
    "Method 1 — Contact HR/administrator (recommended)",
    "Method 2 — Send a request email",
    "3. Data that will be deleted",
    "4. Data retained (anonymized)",
    "5. Important notes",
    "6. Support contact",
    "This page explains how to request deletion of your account and personal data from the AI So Easy Training App in accordance with AI So Easy's policies and Vietnamese personal data protection law.",
    "You have the right to request deletion of your account and personal data at any time. Requests will be processed within 30 business days of valid receipt.",
    "If you still have an employment/collaboration relationship, please contact your HR department or system administrator directly to request account deactivation and deletion.",
    "Send an email to the address below with the following information:",
    "Recipient: user@example.com",
    "Subject: \"Data Deletion Request — [Full Name] — [Employee ID]\"",
    "Email/username currently used in the App.",
    "Employee ID (if any).",
    "Reason for the deletion request (optional).",
    "Confirmation that you understand this action cannot be undone.",
    "Personal profile information: name, email, phone number, avatar.",
    "Learning progress, test results, submitted essays.",
    "Points, badges, learning streaks, mini-game history, and reward redemptions.",
    "Personal electronic certificates in the account.",
    "Comments, reviews, questions/answers tied to your identity.",
    "Push tokens and notifications sent.",
    "Some data will be anonymized (personally identifying information removed) and retained to fulfill legal obligations, audits, and aggregate statistical reporting for AI So Easy:",
    "System logs, login logs (per minimum retention requirements).",
    "Anonymized aggregate training reports (statistics that cannot be traced back to an individual).",
    "Related financial/accounting records (if any) per Vietnamese accounting regulations.",
    "Data deletion cannot be undone. Once processed, you will not be able to log in again or retrieve certificates/learning history.",
    "If you are still an employee/collaborator, deleting your account may affect mandatory training obligations under internal policy — please discuss with HR beforehand.",
    "We may require identity verification before performing the deletion to ensure security.",
    "Email: user@example.com Expected response time: within 5 business days; deletion completed within 30 days.",
    "Contact: user@example.com",
    "© 2026 AI So Easy. All rights reserved."
  ],
